epeated orders kept 13,500 men out of the main Glendale fighting",["$","small",null,{"style":{"display":"block"},"children":"The episode describes seven sets of orders and about 20 miles of marching and countermarching. Magruder reached the Glendale front after the battle, at about 3 a.m. on July 1."}]]}]]}],"$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12"]}]]}],"$L13"]}],"$undefined"]}],"$L14","$L15","$L16",false,"$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c"]}]]}]
